# 2026-05-27  2.6.2    mrosiere regtool      : Manage empty record and add rsw1c register
# 2026-06-06  2.6.3    mrosiere regtool      : Add Name
# 2026-06-25  2.6.4    mrosiere pbcc/rvcc    : Add *gen_csr* in include path
#                               rvcc         : fix stack in linker script
# 2026-07-16  2.6.5    mrosiere component.py : add file filter
# 2026-07-30  2.6.6    mrosiere regtool      : add address in csr pkg and use it in csr module
# 2026-08-02  2.6.7    mrosiere Add default target for deps
# 2026-08-21  2.6.8    mrosiere regtool      : Add enum
# 2026-09-28  2.6.9    mrosiere rvcc         : Update check condition for zicsr
#                               regtool      : Move copy in Makefile
#                               pbcc         : Move rom generation in Makefile
# 2026-10-02  2.7.0    mrosiere rvcc/pbcc/regtool : Use lock for run and write
# 2026-10-05  2.7.1    mrosiere regtool      : Makefile outputs depend on the regtool sources
#                                              ($(shell find), was always empty)
#                               csr_reg      : Add "wo" model
#                               gen_rom      : Exit with status 1 on error
# 2026-10-21  2.8.0    mrosiere ghdl         : add script and Makefile to generate ghdl synth option
# 2026-10-23  2.9.0    mrosiere regtool      : CSR model separated from the generators (csr_model, gen_*)
#                                              memory interface only, buses through the bridges
#                                              sbi2mem, pbi2mem, apb2mem, axi4lite2mem (interface "reg" = "mem")
#                                              Verilog output (parameter language), parameter interface
#                                              pytest unit tests, sim_regtool_<interface>_<scenario> targets
